# BankDash Credit Cards Dashboard

A responsive Credit Cards dashboard UI built using HTML5, custom CSS, and vanilla JavaScript, inspired by the BankDash dashboard design in Figma.

## Features

- Responsive layout for desktop, tablet, and mobile
- Sidebar navigation and dashboard header
- Credit card previews with different styles
- Card expense statistics with a CSS donut chart
- Card list with a View Details modal
- Add New Card form with input validation
- Card settings interaction messages
- Search and filter functionality
- Reusable CSS classes and CSS variables
- Lucide icons

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Lucide Icons

