## How to Run

1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open `index.html` in your browser.
3. For development, you can use the Live Server extension in VS Code.

An internet connection is required to load the Google Fonts and Lucide icons from their CDNs.

## Functionality

- Search filters the credit card previews and card list.
- Add Card validates the input and adds a card to the page.
- View Details displays card information in a modal.
- Card settings show feedback when selected.
- Mobile navigation can be toggled on smaller screens.

## Note

This is a frontend demonstration project using sample data. It is not connected to a real banking service and does not store or process real payment information.
